# Dedicated CLI compile server variant (opt-in speed path, separate from
# vshaxe). Start once:
#   haxe --wait 7822
# Caches macro-expanded modules between runs. Restart the server if a
# stale synthesized-type error appears.
#
# Only run this file if you know a COMPATIBLE server is listening on
# 7822 (started from this checkout). A stray or mismatched server on
# that port answers --connect without error and silently skips the
# run (exit 0, no output) - use plain test-interp.hxml as the safe
# default; it never depends on one.
--connect 7822
test-common.hxml
--interp
